==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Joltik|44}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*'''Jolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Chinchou|71}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
